WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.934
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.467
I'm here with
Lin-Manuel Miranda.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:05.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:08.667
We were talking
about "Encanto" earlier.

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.300
Congratulations on this, bud.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.534
It is the biggest thing ever.

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:14.100
The soundtrack topped
the Billboard 200 chart

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.934
for nine weeks.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:18.634
Soundtrack has sold
over 1 million copies.

00:00:18.634 --> 00:00:20.033
"We Don't Talk About Bruno"

00:00:20.033 --> 00:00:22.467
is the longest reigning
chart topper for Disney

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:24.100
in Billboard history,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.300
making it the biggest
Disney song of all time.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.801
-Yes! Thank you so much.
Thank you.

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:29.901
-No, that's --

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:31.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:34.100
But you -- you wrote
all these giant songs.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.067
You wrote, like, eight of
these songs on the soundtrack.

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.100
That's amazing. You did this.
-It's crazy.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.100
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.133
-But have you ever
performed it?

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:42.801
-I never have.

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:45.501
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:48.133
-Well, I thought maybe,
if you're on the "Tonight Show,"

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:50.167
we always have --

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:53.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:54.601
-Okay.
-Yeah?

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:55.601
-Yeah.
-Okay.

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:56.934
I have --

00:00:56.934 --> 00:01:01.033
If you don't mind, I have
a caterpillar costume for you.

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:02.200
-Well, now we have to do it.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.601
-[ Laughs ]
-Yeah, let's go.

00:01:03.601 --> 00:01:04.868
